OL,3,ABorrowers expecting mortgage rates to
OL,4,Adrop have hopes dashed
OL,5,
OL,6,FNearly all the major mortgage lenders
OL,7,Fin the UK have announced increases in
OL,8,Fthe cost of home loans in recent days.
OL,10,FAnalysts are uncertain over whether
OL,11,Fthere are more to come, but are urging
OL,12,Fpeople who need to find a new deal to
OL,13,Fact now.
OL,15,FSomeone whose five-year deal is coming
OL,16,Fto an end faces paying more than #5,000
OL,17,Fmore a year on their next deal under a
OL,18,Ftypical rate, if they borrow the same
OL,19,Famount of money.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
