OL,3,ABorrowers expecting mortgage rates to
OL,4,Adrop have hopes dashed
OL,5,
OL,6,FMany lenders allow people to lock in a
OL,7,Fnew deal six months before their
OL,8,Fcurrent one comes to an end, with an
OL,9,Fopportunity to switch if the costs come
OL,10,Fdown before it kicks in.
